{"5077030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bang Bang Boom Pow", "steam_appid": 5077030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5176980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Howdy, gunslinger!</strong> Ready to embark on a bounty hunt and become the greatest legend of the Wild West?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of <strong>Kid Smooth Bullet</strong> and take on notorious outlaws with massive bounties on their heads in thrilling duels where every second counts. <strong>DODGE, PARRY, SHOOT</strong> and become the ultimate <strong>TRIGGER MASTER</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/3a73e03e182a38c5d5ba86ead7717d77.poster.avif?t=1788313454\" width=288 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/3a73e03e182a38c5d5ba86ead7717d77.webm?t=1788313454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/3a73e03e182a38c5d5ba86ead7717d77.mp4?t=1788313454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and counter system inspired by <strong>Punch-Out!!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire exactly when the countdown ends to deal a massive damage bonus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry system: use your feint at the perfect moment to send your opponent's bullet back. Be careful—they can do the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn the highest score possible in every stage to become the greatest gunslinger in the West.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies bluff and fake attacks to fool you, so stay sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>unique duels</strong>, each with its own personality, attack patterns, and challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends in <strong>split-screen PvP</strong>, where you can choose from <strong>more than 20 duelists</strong>, each with their own unique abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/988e1c94e40d9119b7b3b91b737867e2.avif?t=1788313454\" width=792 height=602 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or try to reach the top of the <strong>leaderboards</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/649a51e574e9002627628d42b0b9fc27.avif?t=1788313454\" width=782 height=599 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Howdy, gunslinger!</strong> Ready to embark on a bounty hunt and become the greatest legend of the Wild West?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of <strong>Kid Smooth Bullet</strong> and take on notorious outlaws with massive bounties on their heads in thrilling duels where every second counts. <strong>DODGE, PARRY, SHOOT</strong> and become the ultimate <strong>TRIGGER MASTER</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/3a73e03e182a38c5d5ba86ead7717d77.poster.avif?t=1788313454\" width=288 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/3a73e03e182a38c5d5ba86ead7717d77.webm?t=1788313454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/3a73e03e182a38c5d5ba86ead7717d77.mp4?t=1788313454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge and counter system inspired by <strong>Punch-Out!!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire exactly when the countdown ends to deal a massive damage bonus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parry system: use your feint at the perfect moment to send your opponent's bullet back. Be careful—they can do the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn the highest score possible in every stage to become the greatest gunslinger in the West.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your enemies bluff and fake attacks to fool you, so stay sharp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>unique duels</strong>, each with its own personality, attack patterns, and challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your friends in <strong>split-screen PvP</strong>, where you can choose from <strong>more than 20 duelists</strong>, each with their own unique abilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/988e1c94e40d9119b7b3b91b737867e2.avif?t=1788313454\" width=792 height=602 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or try to reach the top of the <strong>leaderboards</strong>!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5077030/extras/649a51e574e9002627628d42b0b9fc27.avif?t=1788313454\" width=782 height=599 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Become the greatest gunslinger in the Wild West in this first-person boss rush with roguelike elements, where the fastest draw wins. Face dozens of unique duelists, each with their own abilities and mysteries, or challenge your friends in split-screen duels. with a unique hand drawn style!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "33 – GMTK 2026<br>", "header_image": "https://s